---
/**
 * Shown on pages whose legal wording has not yet been reviewed by counsel.
 * Remove this component from each page once the text is approved.
 */
---

<div
  class="border border-gold-700/40 bg-gold-100/60 px-5 py-4"
  style="border-radius: var(--radius-xs)"
>
  <p class="eyebrow text-gold-700">Draft pending legal review</p>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-[68ch] text-[0.875rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
    This wording is a working draft prepared for the site build. It describes the company's actual
    practices but has not been reviewed by counsel, and the marked fields are unfilled. Obtain review
    before publishing, then remove this notice.
  </p>
</div>
